  <title>宝武镁业：镁铝价格比倒挂，成本的降低促进了镁在汽车领域的应用</title>
  <link>https://xueqiu.com/8353550788/389512086</link>
  <guid isPermaLink="false">https://xueqiu.com/8353550788/389512086</guid>
