<item>
  <title>宝武镁业：镁合金已批量替代电池护板、车筐、挡泥板、饰件等塑料件，龙头企业渗透率快速提升</title>
  <link>https://xueqiu.com/8353550788/389512083</link>
  <guid isPermaLink="false">https://xueqiu.com/8353550788/389512083</guid>
  <pubDate>Mon, 18 May 2026 09:40:52 +0000</pubDate>
